OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy to start for most
OL,6,Fareas with some mist and fog patches.
OL,7,FAny fog will clear to leave a fine day
OL,8,Fwith good sunny spells. Light winds
OL,9,Fbut breezy around the coast. Feeling
OL,10,Fwarm in the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA clear evening. patchy mist
OL,13,Fand fog develops overnight,
OL,14,Fpotentially becoming more widespread
OL,15,Fin the west than last night. Cool in
OL,16,Frural areas under clear skies. Light
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
