OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny overnight mist and fog
OL,6,Fwill clear through the morning to a
OL,7,Ffurther fine and bright day. Feeling
OL,8,Fmild for most. Light winds but
OL,9,Fbreezier for coastal areas.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,12,FPotentially a foggy start with cloud
OL,13,Fand patchy rain later for Sunday. Fine
OL,14,Fand dry on Monday and Tuesday.
OL,15,FTemperatures around average. Turning
OL,16,Fbreezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
